   "textLength": 594,
   "text": "The flexible box layout module (usually referred to as flexbox) is a one-dimensional layout model for distributing space between items and includes numerous alignment capabilities. This article gives an outline of the main features of flexbox, which we will explore in more detail in the rest of these guides.\nWhen we describe flexbox as being one-dimensional we are describing the fact that flexbox ",
